plies that came from a recent shipment that was issued regarding the destruction and extermination of these items. Intrigued, You load the tape into a VCR. 18th of October 2000, The Genesis Institute for Aesthetic Enhancement has just entered a severe lock down. Whilst the person you are watching who recorded this tape, is still trapped inside.. The monstrous creations has escaped their confinement and are thirsty for blood. Will you escape? Or will you fall victim to the amalgamated monkes fallen victim to the horrific experiments of the Genesis Facility..", "short_description": "18th of October 2000, The Genesis Institute for Aesthetic Enhancement has just entered a severe lock down. Whilst you\u2019re still trapped inside.. The unethical experiments have set themselves free and want their revenge. Will you escape? Or fall victim to the monstrous creations of the Genesis Facility.."}]}, "developer_name": "Patchwork", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/static-legacy/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GoofyGuy", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/static-legacy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "23970583059208728"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035396